  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Target:</strong> A magic suit of armor, implement, shield, or weapon.</p>\n<p>The magic special abilities on the item become greatly improved while hacked, gaining the following benefits, depending on the special ability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The item’s enhancement bonus and critical multiplier is treated as +1 higher for the purposes of magic special abilities that rely on it.</li>\n<li>If the special ability deals additional damage dice (such as flaming or holy), its die size increases by 1 (d4 &gt; d6 &gt; d8 &gt; d10 &gt; d12).</li>\n<li>If the special ability involves a saving throw, it increases by +2 + 1 per 6 associated ranks you possess.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
